            <ArticleTitle>Palladium-Catalyzed Domino Heck/Aryne Carbopalladation/C-H Functionalization: Synthesis of Heterocycle-Fused 9,10-Dihydrophenanthrenes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>842-845</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.orglett.6b03833</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A novel palladium-catalyzed domino Heck/aryne carbopalladation/C-H functionalization reaction using in situ generated arynes has been developed in which three new C-C bonds and a carbon quaternary center are formed. This methodology affords moderate to excellent yields of heterocycle-fused 9,10-dihydrophenanthrenes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
